# ─── Compiled output ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# MetaEditor rebuilds this from source in seconds. A binary in the history is
# also a binary that goes stale silently while the source moves on. Ship it as
# a GitHub Release instead.
*.ex5

# ─── Compile log ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# UTF-16 build output. It embeds absolute local paths and the MetaTrader
# terminal GUID, neither of which belongs in a public repository.
*.log

# ─── Manual snapshots ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Superseded by git history from here on.
/backup/

# ─── Companion web service ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Scanner.php and its migration are a CodeIgniter controller belonging to the
# ride-trades site, not to this EA. They live with that project.
/website/

# ─── OS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
